The files in this directory -- x402-handshake.gif and make-hero-gif.py --
were created from scratch for this repository. The GIF is not derived from any
third-party artwork, stock footage or clip; every frame is drawn programmatically
by make-hero-gif.py using Pillow, and the only external input is the DejaVu Sans
Mono typeface (DejaVu Fonts License, a permissive Bitstream Vera derivative,
which permits embedding and redistribution of rendered output).

To the extent possible under law, Vedant Anand has waived all copyright and
related or neighboring rights to these files. They may be reused for any
